#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:4
msgid "VDI Gateways"
msgstr "VDI Gateways"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:9
msgid ""
"VDI Gateways provide a secure connection point between end users and VDI "
"desktop sessions. A gateway acts as a proxy, routing VDI traffic through a "
"controlled network path. This is essential for environments where VDI "
"desktops reside on isolated networks not directly accessible to end users."
msgstr ""
"VDI Gateways proporcionar un seguro conexión punto entre usuarios finales y "
"VDI desktop sessions. Un gateway acts como un proxy, routing VDI traffic a "
"través de un controlled network ruta. Este es essential para entornos donde "
"VDI desktops reside en isolated networks no directamente accessible a "
"usuarios finales."

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:11
msgid "VDI Gateways are managed from ``Tools > VDI Pools > Gateways`` tab."
msgstr ""
"VDI Gateways son administrado desde ``Tools > VDI Pools > Gateways`` "
"pestaña."

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:13
msgid ""
"VDI Gateways require the ``services-vdi-pools`` Role permission (Read or "
"Full)."
msgstr ""
"VDI Gateways requerir el ``services-vdi-pools`` Rol permiso (Read o "
"Completo)."

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:16
msgid "Gateway Architecture"
msgstr "Gateway Architecture"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:18
msgid ""
"The VDI Gateway sits between the user's browser and the Guacamole session:"
msgstr ""
"El VDI Gateway sits entre el usuario's browser y el Guacamole session:"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:20
msgid "User Browser → VDI Gateway → Guacamole Server → VDI Desktop (RDP/VNC)"
msgstr ""
"Usuario Browser → VDI Gateway → Guacamole Servidor → VDI Desktop (RDP/VNC)"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:24
msgid "This architecture enables:"
msgstr "Este architecture habilita:"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:26
msgid ""
"**Network isolation** — VDI desktops can be on a private network "
"inaccessible to users directly"
msgstr ""
"**Red isolation** — VDI desktops puede be en un privado network inaccessible"
" a usuarios directamente"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:27
msgid ""
"**Load distribution** — Multiple gateways can distribute connection load"
msgstr ""
"**Load distribution** — Múltiples gateways puede distribute conexión load"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Security** — All VDI traffic routes through a controlled proxy with API "
"key authentication"
msgstr ""
"**Seguridad** — Todos VDI traffic routes a través de un controlled proxy con"
" API clave autenticación"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:29
msgid ""
"**Geographic distribution** — Place gateways closer to users for reduced "
"latency"
msgstr ""
"**Geographic distribution** — Place gateways closer a usuarios para reduced "
"latencia"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:32
