msgstr "Navegue un ``Tools > VDI Pools``"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:35
msgid "Select the **Gateways** tab"
msgstr "Seleccionar el **Gateways** pestaña"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:36
msgid "Click :guilabel:`+ ADD`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`+ AGREGAR`"

