msgid "Unique name for the gateway (must be unique per tenant)"
msgstr "Único nombre para el gateway (debe be único per tenant)"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:41
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "DESCRIPTION"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:42
msgid "Optional description of the gateway's purpose or location"
msgstr "Opcional descripción del gateway's purpose o location"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:44
msgid "GATEWAY URL"
msgstr "GATEWAY URL"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:44
msgid ""
"The URL where the gateway service is accessible (e.g., ``https://vdi-"
"gw.example.com:8443``)"
msgstr ""
"El URL donde el gateway servicio es accessible (e.g., ``https://vdi-"
"gw.example.com:8443``)"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:46
#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:58
msgid "Click :guilabel:`SAVE`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`SAVE`"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:48
msgid ""
"Upon creation, |morpheus| generates an **API Key** for the gateway. This key"
" is used by the gateway service to authenticate with the |morpheus| "
"appliance."
msgstr ""
"Upon creation, |morpheus| genera un **API Key** para el gateway. Este clave "
"es utilizado por el gateway servicio a authenticate con el |morpheus| "
"appliance."

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:50
msgid ""
"Copy the API Key immediately after creation. It is used to configure the "
"gateway service and cannot be retrieved later (only regenerated)."
msgstr ""
"Copiar el API Clave immediately después de creation. It se usa para "
"configure el gateway servicio y cannot be retrieved later (solo "
"regenerated)."

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:53
msgid "Editing a VDI Gateway"
msgstr "Editing un VDI Gateway"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:55
#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:65
msgid "Navigate to ``Tools > VDI Pools > Gateways``"
msgstr "Navegue un ``Tools > VDI Pools > Gateways``"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:56
msgid "Click the gateway name or select the edit action"
msgstr "Click el gateway nombre o seleccionar el editar acción"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:57
msgid "Modify the name, description, or gateway URL"
msgstr "Modify el nombre, descripción, o gateway URL"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:60
msgid ""
"The API Key cannot be changed through the edit interface. To regenerate a "
"key, delete and recreate the gateway."
msgstr ""
"El API Clave cannot be cambiado a través de el editar interfaz. A regenerate"
" un clave, eliminar y recreate el gateway."

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:63
msgid "Deleting a VDI Gateway"
msgstr "Deleting un VDI Gateway"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:66
msgid "Select the gateway to delete"
msgstr "Seleccionar el gateway a eliminar"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:67
msgid "Click :guilabel:`DELETE`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`DELETE`"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:68
msgid "Confirm deletion"
msgstr "Confirmar deletion"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:70
msgid ""
"A gateway cannot be deleted if it is currently assigned to one or more VDI "
"Pools. Remove the gateway assignment from all pools before deleting."
msgstr ""
"Un gateway cannot be eliminado si it es actualmente asignado un one o más "
"VDI Pools. Eliminar el gateway assignment desde todos pools antes de "
"deleting."

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:73
msgid "Assigning Gateways to Pools"
msgstr "Assigning Gateways a Pools"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:75
msgid "VDI Gateways are assigned at the Pool level:"
msgstr "VDI Gateways son asignado en el Pool nivel:"

