msgid "Edit or create a VDI Pool"
msgstr "Editar o crear un VDI Pool"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:79
msgid ""
"In the pool configuration, select the desired **Gateway** from the dropdown"
msgstr ""
"En el pool configuración, seleccionar el desired **Gateway** desde el "
"dropdown"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:80
msgid "Save the pool"
msgstr "Guardar el pool"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:82
msgid ""
"When a gateway is assigned to a pool, all user sessions for that pool route "
"through the specified gateway."
msgstr ""
"Cuando un gateway es asignado un un pool, todos usuario sessions para ese "
"pool route a través de el specified gateway."

