#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:149
msgid ""
"**Gateway unreachable:** Verify the Gateway URL is accessible from the "
"|morpheus| appliance and from end-user browsers"
msgstr ""
"**Gateway unreachable:** Verificar el Gateway URL es accessible desde el "
"|morpheus| appliance y desde end-usuario browsers"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:150
msgid ""
"**Authentication failed:** Ensure the API Key configured on the gateway "
"service matches the one generated in |morpheus|"
msgstr ""
"**Autenticación falló:** Asegurar el API Clave configurado en el gateway "
"servicio matches el one generado en |morpheus|"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:151
msgid ""
"**Cannot delete gateway:** Remove the gateway assignment from all VDI Pools "
"first"
msgstr ""
"**Cannot delete gateway:** Eliminar el gateway assignment desde todos VDI "
"Pools primero"

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/gateways.rst:152
msgid ""
"**Sessions not routing through gateway:** Verify the pool has the gateway "
"assigned and that the gateway service is running"
msgstr ""
"**Sessions not routing through gateway:** Verificar el pool tiene el gateway"
" asignado y ese el gateway servicio está en ejecución"
